&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel domain experience (e.g., online booking / travel management platforms such as Navan or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a new team or product area from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
