&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organic search is one of Airbnb&#39;s largest and most efficient acquisition channels, and the rise of AI answer engines is reshaping how travelers discover places to stay, things to do, and trusted Hosts. This role sits at the intersection of growth marketing, content strategy, and emerging AI search behavior, partnering closely with product, engineering, content, and data science teams to make Airbnb the trusted source that search engines and AI models cite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Growth Marketing Lead, SEO, AEO, GEO, you will own the strategy and day-to-day execution for how Airbnb shows up in Google, AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, and the assistants that come next. You are an execution-focused operator with a career built in SEO — you write your own SQL, size opportunities from raw data, and ship. Success in this role means measurable gains in organic visibility, rankings, AI citations, traffic, bookings, and downstream conversion, along with a measurement framework that proves the business value of organic channels. This is a chance to define what AEO and GEO mean for Airbnb and build the playbook others follow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the organic growth strategy and content roadmap across SEO, AEO (Answer Engine Optimization), and GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) — covering technical SEO, content, on-site experience, and visibility in AI assistants such as ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Gemini, and Perplexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage internal content strategy for these acquisition channels: set priorities, briefs, templates, and quality standards for content and landing pages that drive organic and AI-referred traffic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the channel hands-on — pull and analyze your own data in SQL, size opportunities, prioritize by impact, and drive launches and experiments from backlog to measured result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional relationships with product and engineering teams, embedding SEO and AEO best practices into web properties, app surfaces, and structured data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how well AI models understand Airbnb&#39;s listings, product, and policies so they represent Airbnb accurately and cite it as a source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve the measurement framework for SEO, AEO, and GEO — attribution models, leading and lagging indicators, dashboards, and revenue impact — including the ability to demonstrate the value of work that&#39;s difficult to attribute, such as preventive technical work or emerging AI channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish Airbnb&#39;s point of view on how AI-generated answers are reshaping travel discovery, and translate complex technical concepts into clear business narratives for senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in SEO, including 2+ years in a senior/leadership capacity engaging with executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills, writing your own queries to analyze crawl, log, search console, and conversion data without relying on analysts for core questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping SEO programs at scale and driving significant organic growth, from prioritization through launch and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in both technical SEO and content strategy, including site architecture, structured data, indexation, and content quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of how AI-powered search and answer engines operate (LLM-based retrieval, citation behavior, entity recognition), with a clear point of view on how to optimize for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical foundation, comfortable with attribution challenges and building measurement frameworks that quantify the business impact of organic channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with engineering, product, content, and data science teams to implement SEO and AEO improvements at scale, and a track record of developing and retaining high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: experience in a two-sided marketplace or travel business where listing, location, and user-generated content pages are major organic surfaces; background in international SEO across multiple markets and languages; experience building programmatic or product-led SEO at scale; early-mover experience in AEO/GEO visibility monitoring and optimization; hands-on skill with Python, BigQuery, or similar tools and log/crawl analysis at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent combination of education and progressive experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb values diversity &amp;amp; belonging and is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. All individuals seeking employment at Airbnb are considered without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, gender, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$245,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a Senior Director of Publishing Production to join an unannounced game team remotely in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are in the development stages of one of our new unannounced projects, and are looking for passionate game makers to collaborate, get in early and make their mark on this exciting venture!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Director of Production, you will lead &lt;strong&gt;Publishing Production&lt;/strong&gt; for one of Scopely&#39;s newest mobile titles. Reporting to the VP of Production, you&#39;ll sit at the intersection of Publishing, Development, and Marketing, ensuring ambitious ideas become exceptional player experiences through operational excellence, clear execution and trusted cross-functional partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a production leader who enjoys turning strategy into action, thrives in complex cross-functional environments, and isn&#39;t afraid to roll up their sleeves to solve difficult execution challenges while continuously improving how teams work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Publishing Production for the project, translating strategic priorities into coordinated execution across Development, Marketing, Licensing, Live Operations and Publishing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary operational bridge between Development and Publishing, ensuring product roadmaps, marketing campaigns, licensing initiatives and player-facing moments remain aligned from planning through execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive end-to-end execution of major publishing initiatives, including soft launch, global launch, integrated marketing campaigns, licensed IP activations, community moments and other high-impact player experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategic direction into actionable execution by establishing clear ownership, priorities, planning frameworks and decision-making rhythms that enable teams to move quickly and confidently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted partnerships across Product, Development, Marketing, Community, User Acquisition, CRM, Customer Experience and external partners, aligning diverse teams around shared objectives while navigating competing priorities and dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance immediate execution with long-term operational excellence by stepping directly into complex production challenges, removing blockers and continuously improving the systems, processes and ways of working behind them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Live Operations, Release Management and Development teams to ensure publishing priorities are fully integrated into release schedules and operational readiness, while maintaining clear ownership across organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide meaningful production visibility to senior leadership through clear communication, risk management, health reporting and actionable recommendations that support informed decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a growing Publishing Production function, establishing high standards for execution, collaboration and accountability while creating an environment where producers can operate with increasing autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading Production, Publishing Production or Program Management within a mobile live-service game, partnering closely with both Development and Publishing organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering complex cross-functional publishing initiatives, including product launches, integrated marketing campaigns, licensing or external partnerships, and large-scale player-facing experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of mobile game development and publishing, including the operational complexity, release cadence and planning required to support successful live-service games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate strategic priorities into clear execution plans while remaining hands-on enough to remove blockers, resolve ambiguity and keep teams moving forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing peers and senior leaders to drive alignment across multiple organizations without relying on direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to establish scalable production practices, governance and planning processes that improve execution quality, predictability and organizational effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing producers or production leaders while fostering ownership, accountability and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment balancing player experience, development realities, publishing priorities, operational risk and business objectives in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to tailor messaging and build alignment across technical, creative and business audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping or operating successful mobile free-to-play games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with licensed IPs and complex external partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting games through soft launch, global launch and long-term live operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with co-development studios or globally distributed development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Marketing, User Acquisition, CRM, Community or Customer Experience organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with release management, incident management or operational readiness for large-scale live games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For candidates in CA, CO, NJ, NY, and WA, the annual salary range is provided below. In addition to base pay, employees may be eligible for equity, bonuses, and a comprehensive benefits package, including healthcare benefits, retirement benefits, pet insurance, paid holidays, paid Scopely free days, and unlimited paid time off. Base pay offered may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA, CO, NJ, NY, and WA Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$193,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$284,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact recruiting@scopely.com. Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director of Product, Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team to join us on an exciting unannounced title built on a globally recognized IP. This is a F2P, mobile-first live-service game currently in pre-production. This role can be remote in the US and Canada, or hybrid in Culver City.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the gaming industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a thought leader in game development, directing F2P systems and live ops around core gameplay in collaboration with game design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft and communicate compelling product narratives that inspire teams and anchor decisions—whether influencing executive stakeholders or aligning pods to core outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push innovation forward in a blue ocean design space, connecting us to proven game mechanics, and driving to our USP and F2P viability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate ideas through the lens of product goals, user value, market opportunity, and creative resonance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, high-quality product feedback, continuously improving design quality while preserving momentum. See where ideas shine, where they falter, and make good tradeoffs with empathy and rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct multidisciplinary pods to deliver against product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own roadmaps, setting priorities and building clear frameworks to evaluate opportunities and trade-offs across features and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch your own design proposals, iterate on others’, and synthesize diverse perspectives into focused product strategies. Be known for your ability to make others&#39; ideas stronger.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that gameplay, monetization, systems, and social features converge into a cohesive, scalable F2P live service—grounded in mobile-first design but thriving across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on the pulse of the industry—analyzing game trends, innovations and evolutions, and player behavior across markets to inform gameplay solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and integrate emerging technologies, including generative AI, to accelerate development and enrich player experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define the product culture and best practices that will make Scopely a leader in mobile-first, cross-platform F2P development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A student of why games succeed, especially in the F2P midcore mobile space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep passion for games - you&#39;re as creative as you are analytical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading successful free to play product development on mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive clarity in ambiguity, especially during pre-production and early development phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, play-to-win mindset paired with executional excellence—you can zoom out to big-picture goals and zoom in to unblock the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with licensed IP and navigating both creative opportunities and brand considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, storytelling, and influencing skills—you’re trusted by creatives, designers, engineers, and execs alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative fluency.&amp;nbsp; An ability to see what numbers do and &lt;em&gt;don’t &lt;/em&gt;say about development priorities and game performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the full product lifecycle—from concept and pre-production through launch and live operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For candidates in CA, CO, NJ, NY, and WA, the annual salary range is provided below. In addition to base pay, employees may be eligible for equity, bonuses, and a comprehensive benefits package, including healthcare benefits, retirement benefits, pet insurance, paid holidays, paid Scopely free days, and unlimited paid time off. Base pay offered may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA, CO, NJ, NY, and WA Annual Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$223,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$281,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
